    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62175" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεαίνω</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειαίνω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
