					<u>PA</u>
					674b21
				</span></i>
			; 
				Ep.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειᾰνέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.261
				</span></i>
			: aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέηνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.200
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				70.15
			</span></i>, -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱνα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				788b31
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλείανα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.372<i>E</i>11
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				373.174
			</span></i>; 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλείηνα, λείηνα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.260
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				18
			</span></i> B <i><span class="en">
				p.101
			</span></i> H.: 
				Ep.
			aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειηνάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					646
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				270e
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεάνθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.158
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.130
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειανθέωσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.168
				</span></i>
			; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειανθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					11.13.2
				</span></i>
			, Philotim. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				4.10.1
			</span></i>: pf.inf.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λελειάνθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					30.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.510
			</span></i>; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λελεασμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Damocr.
				</span></i>
